{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">熱帶風暴「紫檀」連日在北部灣徘徊，為廣西帶來強降雨。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">崇左市持續多日暴雨，引發龍州縣和寧明縣出現洪水。龍州縣域內左江水位持續上升，地勢低窪區域淹浸，救援橡皮艇穿梭在街道小巷，尋找同轉移被困民眾。有村莊被洪水圍困，當局要出動無人機協助，運送救災物資給村民。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.FLOOD-1200_002.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026cR3N3W7NCF1787635289.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.CN.FLOOD-1200_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">寧明縣城區積水，一度最深約4米，當局出動橡皮艇撤離民眾。有鄉鎮求助稱，有獨居老人同小童需撤離，武警出動救援。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-25T05:40:11.084273+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":182,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}